sglasso 1.2.0 (development)

* Add family="binomial" using the validated accelerated RcppArmadillo
  IRLS/proximal-Newton, block and APG core, compiled at package installation.
* Add training-only groupwise Firth targets and fold-local log-loss CV.
* Add binomial probability/link prediction, numerical diagnostics and strict
  nonconvergence errors. Finite-grid endpoint selections are reported, not
  misrepresented as convergence failures or global tuning optima.
* Preserve the Gaussian numerical path and default API behavior.
* Binomial information-criterion selection, nonstandardized fitting, lazy
  transformation and SSR_fast are intentionally unsupported (explicit errors).
* Use portable BLAS/LAPACK/Fortran linking settings instead of machine paths.
